{
  "evals": [
    {
      "id": "vcn-segment-full-pipeline-local-docker",
      "prompt": "Run the full Visual ChangeNet **segmentation** pipeline (train \u2192 evaluate \u2192 inference) on a mini dataset, using **local Docker** on the host machine for GPU execution.\n\n## Plugin Installation\n\nThis eval depends on the `tao-skills` plugin (bundled in the `tao-skills-external` repo). Install it fresh so the SessionStart hook fires:\n\n```bash\nPLUGIN_ROOT=\"${{CI_PROJECT_DIR:-$HOME/tao-skills-external}}\"\nrm -rf ~/.claude/plugins/cache/tao-skill-bank/tao-skills\n```\n\n```\n/plugin marketplace add $PLUGIN_ROOT\n/plugin install tao-skills@tao-skill-bank\n/plugin marketplace update tao-skill-bank\n```\n\n## Skill under test\n\n`visual-changenet` (segment task).\n\n## Execution platform\n\n**Local Docker** \u2014 host's Docker daemon, NVIDIA runtime.\n\nThe TAO SDK is optional for this platform; plain `docker run` is sufficient. If you opt into the SDK, a Python venv is available at `/opt/tao-sdk-venv/bin/python`.\n\n## Data \u2014 download from S3 to local disk first\n\nPull the dataset and the backbone checkpoint to local disk before any docker run. Use the host's `aws` CLI with the `ACCESS_KEY` / `SECRET_KEY` env vars.\n\n- Dataset: `s3://nvcf-storage-handling/aws_sochao/changenet/VisualChangeNet_mini` (~70 images, small)\n- Backbone: `s3://nvcf-storage-handling/aws_sochao/changenet/pretrained/NV_DINOV2_518_16_256.ckpt`\n\nSuggested local staging layout:\n\n```\n~/workspace/visual-changenet/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 dataset/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 backbone/\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 NV_DINOV2_518_16_256.ckpt\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 results/\n```\n\nIf either download fails for credentials / network reasons, **stop and report** \u2014 do not synthesize stub data.\n\n## Spec overrides (segment task, smoke-test scale)\n\n- `dataset.segment.root_dir` \u2192 container-side path bind-mounted from the local dataset dir\n- `model.backbone.pretrained_backbone_path` \u2192 container-side path of the downloaded backbone\n- `dataset.segment.batch_size` = 4\n- `train.num_epochs` = 2\n- `train.num_gpus` = 1\n- `train.checkpoint_interval` = 2\n- `train.validation_interval` = 2\n\n## Pipeline (single run, three actions)\n\n1. **Train** \u2014 wait for completion; verify `Execution status: PASS` in logs.\n2. **Evaluate** \u2014 using the train checkpoint that landed in the train action's results directory.\n3. **Inference** \u2014 using the train checkpoint.\n\nThe segment-task checkpoint filename is `changenet_model_segment_latest.pth`.\n\n## Artifacts to upload (save under {artifacts_dir})\n\n- `{artifacts_dir}/train_log.txt`\n- `{artifacts_dir}/evaluate_log.txt`\n- `{artifacts_dir}/inference_log.txt`\n- `{artifacts_dir}/docker_runs.json` \u2014 per-action: image used, container name, exit code, start/end timestamps\n- `{artifacts_dir}/metrics.json` \u2014 parsed `val_acc`, `miou` from logs\n\n## Execution constraints\n\n- Run docker commands in the **foreground** with a generous timeout (~1 hour).\n- This box is airgapped \u2014 do NOT pull images fresh from registries; use whatever is already loaded locally.\n- After each docker run, retrieve logs via `docker logs <name>` before removing the container.\n\n## Expected outcome\n\nAll three actions (train, evaluate, inference) complete with `Execution status: PASS`. Logs + parsed metrics saved under `{artifacts_dir}`.",
      "expected_outcome": "All three local-docker actions (train, evaluate, inference) reach `Execution status: PASS`. `metrics.json` contains numeric `val_acc` and `miou`. `docker_runs.json` records per-action container metadata. No Lepton-side activity; pipeline is host-local."
    },
    {
      "id": "vcn-segment-full-pipeline-lepton",
      "prompt": "Run the full Visual ChangeNet **segmentation** pipeline (train \u2192 evaluate \u2192 inference) on a mini dataset, using **Lepton** (DGX Cloud) for GPU execution.\n\n## Plugin Installation\n\nThis eval depends on the `tao-skills` plugin (bundled in the `tao-skills-external` repo). Install it fresh so the SessionStart hook fires:\n\n```bash\nPLUGIN_ROOT=\"${{CI_PROJECT_DIR:-$HOME/tao-skills-external}}\"\nrm -rf ~/.claude/plugins/cache/tao-skill-bank/tao-skills\n```\n\n```\n/plugin marketplace add $PLUGIN_ROOT\n/plugin install tao-skills@tao-skill-bank\n/plugin marketplace update tao-skill-bank\n```\n\n## Skill under test\n\n`visual-changenet` (segment task).\n\n## Execution platform\n\n**Lepton** \u2014 DGX Cloud managed compute.\n\nA Python venv is available at `/opt/tao-sdk-venv/bin/python` for any SDK calls.\n\n## Test dataset (already on S3)\n\n- Dataset: `s3://nvcf-storage-handling/aws_sochao/changenet/VisualChangeNet_mini` (~70 images)\n- Backbone: `s3://nvcf-storage-handling/aws_sochao/changenet/pretrained/NV_DINOV2_518_16_256.ckpt`\n\n## Spec overrides (segment task, smoke-test scale)\n\n- `dataset.segment.root_dir` \u2192 the S3 dataset path above\n- `model.backbone.pretrained_backbone_path` \u2192 the S3 backbone path above\n- `dataset.segment.batch_size` = 4\n- `train.num_epochs` = 2\n- `train.num_gpus` = 1\n- `train.checkpoint_interval` = 2\n- `train.validation_interval` = 2\n\n## Lepton resource\n\n- `workspace_id`: `f8zb9s0r`\n- `resource_shape`: `gpu.h100-sxm`\n- `dedicated_node_group`: `gcp-iad-lepton-002-vnbwicri`\n\n## Pipeline (single run, three actions)\n\n1. **Train** \u2014 submit train job, poll until done, verify `Execution status: PASS` in logs.\n2. **Evaluate** \u2014 submit evaluate job using the train checkpoint.\n3. **Inference** \u2014 submit inference job using the train checkpoint.\n\nThe segment-task checkpoint filename is `changenet_model_segment_latest.pth`.\n\n## Artifacts to upload (save under {artifacts_dir})\n\n- `{artifacts_dir}/train_log.txt`\n- `{artifacts_dir}/evaluate_log.txt`\n- `{artifacts_dir}/inference_log.txt`\n- `{artifacts_dir}/job_handles.json` \u2014 `{{train, evaluate, inference}}` job IDs + final status for each\n- `{artifacts_dir}/metrics.json` \u2014 parsed `val_acc`, `miou` from logs\n\n## Execution constraints\n\n- Lepton `sdk.create_job(...)` calls can take 2\u20135 minutes to validate specs and submit. This is normal \u2014 use a synchronous call with a generous timeout (~1 hour).\n- If a script appears to pause after `SDK initialized successfully`, WAIT \u2014 it is mid-submission. Do NOT kill the process.\n\n## Expected outcome\n\nAll three actions (train, evaluate, inference) complete with `Execution status: PASS`. Logs + parsed metrics saved under `{artifacts_dir}`.",
      "expected_outcome": "All three Lepton-submitted actions (train, evaluate, inference) reach `Execution status: PASS`. `metrics.json` contains numeric `val_acc` and `miou`. `job_handles.json` records all three job IDs."
    }
  ],
